  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Rehabilitacin de la Lnea de Transmisin de Peligre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation of the Peligre Transmission Line</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Inspeccionar la lnea de transmisin elctrica y los detalles de ingeniera bsica para garantizar un sistema de redes confiables de energa elctrica producida por la planta hidroelctrica de Peligre el cual se espera est totalmente restaurada (54MW) en el 2016 a travs de un financiamiento conjunto BID-KFW y el OFID, de un total aproximado de US$ 62.5 millones</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inspect the electrical transmission line and basic engineering details to guarantee a reliable network of electrical energy produced by the Peligre hydroelectric plant which is expected to be fully restored (54MW) in 2016 through a joint funding BID-KFW and OFID of a total of approximately U.S. $ 62.5 million</narrative>
  </description>
